  "title": "Judah's firstborn son by Tamar",
  "era": "patriarchs",
  "lifespan": "c. 1850 BC",
  "summary": "Zerah was the firstborn of the twin sons of Judah and Tamar. He was born under dramatic circumstances where the midwife tied a red thread around his hand to mark that he came out first, but his brother Perez pushed past him and was born first. Zerah became the ancestor of the Zerahites.",
