    },
    {
      "title": "Mentioned in Jacob's genealogy",
      "description": "Zerah is mentioned among Jacob's descendants who went down to Egypt, and he is counted as one of the founders of the tribes of Israel.",
      "verses": [
        {
          "bookId": 1,
          "chapter": 46,
          "verses": [
